window.products.push({"id":304076,"name":"Giantex TV Stand for TV up to 50 Inches, 43.5\" Wood Industrial TV Cabinet with 3-Tier Storage Shelves, Adjustable Feet, Entertainment Center TV Consol","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":94.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eedltVN3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description: Perfect TV Console Table Adds an Abundance of Style and Storage to Your Home! Giantex rustic TV stand measures 43.5” x 16.5” x 20.5” (L x W x H) and fit most flat screens up to 50”. It can also be used as a storage rack in the living room, bedroom, study, or office, keeping your living space in a tidy condition. And featuring 3 tiers of storage shelves, the console table is perfect for placing your DVDs, speakers, remote controls, books, ornaments or anything you like. Besides, the metal mesh shelf is good for heat dissipation. To increase sturdiness, our coffee table adopts a high-strength metal frame and thick boards, ensuring long service life. It is also equipped with adjustable non-slip feet on the bottom, which can effectively avoid scratching the ground and keep stable even on uneven ground. With its retro and chic appearance, the entertainment center TV table would make your space more charming and welcoming. Features: Designed with 3 tiers of storage shelves, providing enough space for daily necessities The bottom mesh shelf design promotes air circulation and heat dissipation The side metal mesh design can promote items from falling The sturdy metal frame ensures good sturdiness and durability The non-slip feet can be adjusted to fit various uneven floors, keeping stable Can be served as a TV table, storage rack, entryway table, end table, and more The rustic brown finishes and matte black frame add a rustic style to your room The veneered particle boards are waterproof and smooth for easy cleaning Specifications: Color: Rustic Brown Material: Particle Board, Metal Overall Dimensions: 43.5\" x 16.5\" x 20.5\" (L x W x H) Weight Capacity of the Tabletop: 135 lbs Weight Capacity of the Middle Shelf: 135 lbs Weight Capacity of the Bottom Shelf: 66 lbs Net Weight: 39.5 lbs Package Includes: 1 x TV Stand 1 x User's Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81eedltVN3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Giantex","source_asin":"B0BLBZTW7X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-304076","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLBZTW7X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLBZTW7X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":304077,"name":"Gtongoko 5 Pieces Fireplace Tools Sets Gold Handles Wrought Iron Set and Holder Fireset Fire Pit Stand Rustic Tongs Shovel Brush Poker Wood Stove Hear","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61g06fvqAFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【5 PCS COMBINATION OF FIREPLACE TOOLS】32.5 inch height fireplace tool holder adopts a heavy duty square base for stability.The top support of tools set can not only keep fireplace brush, shovel, poker and tongs neatly fixed, but also saves space and tidy storage, bid farewell to messy. Integrated appearance brings decoration and beauty. 【ERGONOMIC HANDLES】Black iron fire set with rustic heavy golden handle,each tool is retro style and comfortable, which perfectly fits your hand when you sweep ash and reposition wood or coal. It has universal compatibility and can work well with firewood racks and fire screens.No longer afraid of burns or heat when using stoves or fire pits. Exquisite vintage fireplace tool is a trace of the highlights of your stylish garden or living room. 【SIMPLE ASSEMBLY】The fireplace tool set does not require installation tools and screws, just tighten each part one by one. All accessories are easy to install, at the end of winter, they can be disassembled and stored, which will not occupy a lot of space. Suitable for managing indoor and outdoor fireplace. 【STURDY AND SAFELY】The heavy-duty fireplace tools sets are made of durable wrought iron with modern powder coating on the surface. With excellent workmanship, the fireplace tools will not bend and break easily. Most importantly, this fireplace tong can keep you away from the heat and keep a safe distance from the fireplace, but at the same time allows you to manipulate hot burning logs and sweep away dust. 【OUR COMMITMENT】We will try our best to ensure the quality of the fireplace tools set. If you have any questions about our products in the purchase process, please contact us in time, and we will give you a satisfactory reply as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61g06fvqAFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gtongoko","source_asin":"B0BYHPHVH7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-304077","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYHPHVH7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYHPHVH7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
