window.products.push({"id":304153,"name":"FJXMFRAME Vintage 8x10 Picture Frame Gold Antique Picture Frames for Wall Hanging & Tabletop, Ornate Baroque Frames 8x10 or Matted to 5x7 Photo (8x10 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912tuDRqLuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ELEGANT VINTAGE DESIGN: This baroque picture frame is crafted with vintage floral motifs, creating an antique feel to your home or office. The Victorian style design provides a classic courtly touch, while the ornate frame can be easily placed on any desk or shelf. Its intricate exterior relief enhances the vintage feel and you can use it to decorate your bedroom with a touch of elegance. HAND-CRAFTED ANTIQUE FRAMES: Protect your precious memories with our ornate picture frames! Our Bronze gold picture frames are crafted with strong glass to keep photos from bending, tearing, and curling over time. The unique hand-embossed latticework and hand-painted coating on the outside of the resin frame creates a three-dimensional look that's sure to add an aristocratic touch to your home. Invest in our photo frames today and preserve your memories for years to come. WALL OR TABLETOP DISPLAY: This vintage 8x10 picture frame is a must-have for preserving your most cherished memories! Its easy-to-open black velvet back makes inserting photos a breeze, while its two-way serrated hook allows for effortless vertical or horizontal hanging. For added stability and the ability to rotate in any direction, the frame also includes an easel. Showcase your favorite photos and make them last a lifetime - hang this vintage picture frame in any room of your home. FRAME YOUR FAVORITE PHOTOS: Capture the beauty of life and preserve your most meaningful memories with our 8x10 picture frame with mat. Create a special living space with our resin frames, so you can look back and relive your past adventures, or be inspired to start your next journey. Our antique picture frames are the perfect way to keep your most precious memories close to your heart. Get your vintage frames today and appreciate the incredible moments of life. IDEAL GIFTS: A meaningful photo of your loved one is the perfect way to preserve cherished memories that will never be forgotten. Our 8x10 frames are the perfect way to make your memories come alive with a realistic, lifelike image that will grab attention on special occasions such as anniversaries, housewarmings, holidays, weddings, birthdays and family events. Make sure your memories last a lifetime with our wall & tabletop picture frames.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912tuDRqLuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FJXMFRAME","source_asin":"B0BRJGWKXS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-304153","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRJGWKXS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRJGWKXS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":304154,"name":"Carolina Creekhouse Ellie FloorFlat | Decorative Vinyl Floor Covering | Lay Flat | Durable | No Curling Edges | Waterproof | Easy Clean | Wipeable | E","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81myAlC6f9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EYE-CATCHING STYLE Add modern features to your space with our Ellie FloorFlat. Mat features blue and grey graphic lines against a beige backdrop. This contemporary design matches your welcoming personality and home decor-style while at the same time protecting your precious floors. Our 3’ x 5’ mat is the ideal size in front of your tub, washing machine, kitchen sink, and more. BENEFITS OF FLOOR FLATS Our FloorFlats have been developed by design to lay flat on any hard surface floor (not recommended for carpet). Resting flush with your flooring, our low profile 1.5mm flats prevent doors from catching on the mat while opening and closing. The no slip bottom eliminates the need for an additional pad underneath. The edges of the mat never curl so no need to worry about tripping or falling. Plus, these mats unroll flat the first time so you can begin using immediately. DURABLE AND RESISTANT Thin, premium matte vinyl mats protect your floors from spills, scratches, abrasions, and the wear-and-tear of daily use. Spruce up the high traffic spaces in your home without the costly expense of new floors. Our mats are suitable for both indoor and covered outdoor patios. The decorative pattern and dynamic colors provide aesthetic appeal that will continue to please over the years. EASY TO CLEAN Our low maintenance FloorFlats are easy to clean plus stain and fade resistant. These waterproof mats offer trouble-free cleaning in just seconds! Simply wipe with soapy water for a just-like-new finish. Spills, dirt, pet messes – no worries! FloorFlats will quickly become your go-to-solution in many areas of your home. PATRIOTIC AND RESPONSIBLE Our FloorFlats are proudly made in the USA. Your family’s safety is of upmost importance so feel comfortable knowing our materials are eco-friendly and non-toxic.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81myAlC6f9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Carolina Creekhouse","source_asin":"B08X7JZH43","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-304154","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X7JZH43","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X7JZH43","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
