window.products.push({"id":304161,"name":"Inspirational Wall Art for Bedroom Office Decor - 7 RULES OF LIFE Canvas Print 12\"x 16\" Motivational Quotes Abstract Black and White Wall Art Positive","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813XPG3YovL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introduction: Firstly the canvas print art work is printed at high resolution on quality thick artist premium canvas with extra mirrored border. Secondly the canvas is stretched professionally over sturdy wooden stretcher fir frame which is kiln dried. Thirdly the print is wrapped around the sides resulting in a top quality 3-D effect interior decor art work and hook attached. Lastly the print is put into a plastic bag and then put into solid master carton for shipping. Benefits: This design comes already framed and ready to hang. Each panel has a wide hook already attached for easy hanging. 30 days money back guarantee after receipt gives you assurance of a quality product at an affordable price. Well packed and dispatched fast via courier. Decoration: Perfect Choice of Wall Art Decor for such as Living Room, Bathroom, Bedrooms, Hotel, Dinning Room, Hallway, Nurseries, Offices, Coffee House and others. IMPORTANT: Please note display pictures are only for illustration purposes. They were not taken in real display rooms and do not represent the real size of the print set. Using inspirational wall art allows you to have positive reminders every day. Canvas wall art read: 7 Rules of Life 1. Let it Go Never ruin a good day by thinking about a bad yesterday. 2. Ignore Them Don't listed to other people. Live a life that's empowering to you. 3. Give it Time Time heals everything. 4. Don't Compare The only person you should try to beat is the person you were yesterday. 5. Stay Calm It's okay not to have everything figured out. Know that in time, you'll get there. 6. It's on You Only you are in charge of your happiness. 7. Smile Life is short. Enjoy it while you have it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813XPG3YovL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NW ART 777","source_asin":"B09QH2DTV3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-304161","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QH2DTV3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QH2DTV3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
