window.products.push({"id":304397,"name":"Rythome Set of 2 Soft Plush Rabbit Faux Fur Throw Pillow Cases, Luxury Floral Pattern Cushion Covers, Cozy Reversible Pillowslips for Sofa Couch and B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WX+KNwatL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Brand: Rythome Contains: 18\" SQ, 2 pieces. COVER ONLY. Pillow cover dimensions are measured from seam to seam when cover is laid flat. Intended Use: The lush fibers have fabulous texture and instantly cozies up sofas and chairs, for fluffiness you'll want to cuddle up to. Pair them with other solids or add in some pattern for an eclectic look. How to Choose Pillow Insert Size It's typically recommended to use a pillow insert a tad larger than the pillowcase for a nice plump pillow, especially for the older flattened pillows or fiber fill. Sometimes, for 100% Hypoallergenic Polyester Inserts, after filling, pillow will decrease about 10% - 15% in size. These toss pillow covers feature 18\"x18\". So, for best results, now the inserts with 1-2 inches size up are recommended to buy together with the items to provide full pillows from corner to corner. Slight Color Variation or Size Biases Many factors result in slight color variation between physical items and the images on your screen, such as dye lots variation, muted appearance, photographing ambient light, shooting angle, screen resolution. Acceptable size biases may occur in handmade process. Washing Tips: Machine Wash Gentle. Air Dry or Dry Clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71WX+KNwatL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rythome","source_asin":"B08FB13GVS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-304397","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FB13GVS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FB13GVS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
