window.products.push({"id":304572,"name":"HOMEIDEAS Memory Foam Bath Mat Set, Bathroom Rugs Sets 2 Piece, Thick, Soft, Absorbent, Non Slip, Dry Fast, Machine Washable Bathroom Floor Mat, 17x24","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71B1QAsC-7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM MEMORY FOAM & COZY CORAL VELVET - HOMEIDEAS bath mat is filled with high density & slow rebound memory foam and the microfiber coral Fleece outer material. Backed with a non-slip PVC bottom. Thick and fluffy contact surface offers exceptional comfortable feels and helps eliminate pressure on your feet. Enjoy the comfort of standing on the clouds! ABSORB WATER & DRY QUICKLY: Made of Flannel fabric, which has a strong water-absorbent ability, can absorb water quickly. Keep your feet clean and keep your bathroom away from water and stains. How to clean it? - Machine Wash. Put it in cold water with mild detergent. Hang to dry or air dry. Do not Bleach or Dry Clean. Color will not fade. Color will stay nice and vibrant no matter how many times they’ll be washed! NON-SLIP PVC BACKING - HOMEIDEAS Bath Mat Rug is backed with PVC dots to prevent shifting and skidding and that will hold up for years to come. This anti-skid backing has slip resistance on the tile floor surface, that it won’t slip or slide to keep you more safe and cozy. Unlike other rugs where the rubber backing tends to wear and peel off after washing. The rugs are much stronger and durable for long-term use.!!!TIPS: Make sure floors are dry underneath the rug. MULTI-PURPOSE USE – Come with 2 piece: 1 small bath mat 17\"x24\", 1 large bath mat 20\"x32\". HOMEIDEAS elegant bath mat rug can be widely used on various occasions, such as bathroom, kitchen, living room, meeting room, study room, hallway, bedroom, balcony, bathtub side, front of the sink, indoor&outdoor, etc. And from a design viewpoint, this rug can make a significant difference in the overall color scheme of your bathroom scheme or coordinate with bathroom décor or accessories. 100% SATISFACTION WARRANTY - HOMEIDEAS' bathroom rugs carpets offer 30 days warranty time. For any reason you think the bath rugs set is not for you, send 1 simple email with your order ID#, and we will help you solve the problem within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71B1QAsC-7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMEIDEAS","source_asin":"B08GFZYF49","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-304572","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GFZYF49","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GFZYF49","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":304573,"name":"HOMESCAPES Weighted Blanket Reversible Quilt with Cover for Adults - Cooling Breathable Heavy Heated Blanket with Premium Glass Beads (Grey Reversable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TJ4PzP2hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"<p>✔[Calming Weighted Blanket]: Exceptional treated Micro Fabric quality with calming sensory technology  to naturally help calm your body for a restful night of sleep. Plush Holland fabric blanket cover to give you the superior feeling for years to come. Experience a true relaxing and hugging feel!</p> <p>✔[Benefits]: HOMESCAPES adult reversible premium weighted blanket with evenly distributed glass beads is guaranteed to help you fall asleep faster by exerting gentle pressure to improve the quality of your sleep naturally and comfortably. You will feel as though you have been hugged gently with a secure feeling while you sleep. Perfect gift choice for your friends or family anytime of the year.  </p> <p>✔[Unique Specification]: 8 loops are provided for the blanket to attach to the luxurious cover that's included. Carefully engineered 5 dense layers with unique 3-dimensional lock bead sewing technique with 8\" X 8\" bead compartments for even distribution of the weight. HOMESCAPES weighted blankets delivers to you ZERO leakage of beads with superior quality you just can't find anywhere.</p> <p>✔[Temperature Control]: Our unique ultra-soft microfiber heavy weighted blankets are always more breathable and temperature controlling than others. It absorbs moisture to keep your body from overheating to maintain your body heat for a very good night sleep you have ever experienced.</p> <p>✔To choose for an adult, take 10% of the body weight, then add 1lb. The recommended size for one adult is Twin (48\" X 72\" & 48\" X 78\") from 12lb & 15lb or Queen (60\" X 78\") size for max. 2 adults to choose from 12lb, 15lb & 20lb. Get excited to pick from Teal, Grey & Sage colours. Bring life to any setting with comfort. Its a WIN...WIN!</p>","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TJ4PzP2hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMESCAPES","source_asin":"B0B1Q1BN56","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-304573","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1Q1BN56","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1Q1BN56","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
