window.products.push({"id":304611,"name":"Digital Pro Kitchen Food Scale Pocket Jewelry Weight Scale with Upgraded High-Precision Sensor and Tare,PCS Functions-0.01oz(0.1g) to 6.6lb(3000g)-Bat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pBOVwV99L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Antsfam Weight Food Scale is newly upgraded with bigger sensor,giving more accurate weight than normal one.Its minimum weight is 0.01oz/0.1g,which can weight everything,like liquid,flour,vegetable,fruit,snacks,pet's food,medication,jewelry and any more. Specifications - Max Weight Capacity: 3000g - Division: 0.01oz /0.1g - Unit: g/ct/dwt/ozt/oz/gn - Function Buttons: Power / Mode / PCS / Tare - Power: 2 x AAA batteries(included) - Dimensions: 5 x 4 x 0.7 inch  NOTE: The \"0\" option deactivates the auto-off function. How to count pieces: br> Note: All items must be of uniform weight for the counting feature to work. br> 1. Turn on the mini digital kitchen scale. 2. Press and hold the PCS button until you see PCS flash on the top left corner of the lcd display, and a sample count(25) displayed. 3. Press the M button until the display shows the sample count you want(available sample counts are 25/50/60/75/100), then place the sample count on the platform same as the lcd shows, and press PCS button to confirm. 4. Press PCS button again for counting, you may now place any number of the items on the scale, lcd will display a count. What's in the box? - Antsfam Pocket Food Scale - 1 x Scale Cover - 1 x Platform Cover - 1 x User Manual - 1 x Suede Cleaning Cloth - 2 x AAA Batteries","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pBOVwV99L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Antsfam","source_asin":"B071LMT4KQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-304611","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071LMT4KQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071LMT4KQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
