window.products.push({"id":304621,"name":"In the Breeze Battery-Operated Hanging, Rotating Display Motor, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l3RcU8UkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The In the Breeze battery operated Black motor is a simple & easy way to get your hanging decor moving. This motor takes a (1) D-cell battery that can be turned in either direction to determine which way your motor spins. There is a hook at the top & one at the bottom so it can be placed anywhere. We do recommend that this spinning motor be used indoors. The newer your battery is the better & faster This motor will spin. Perfect for displaying items at home or at your business. In the Breeze is a family run, U. S. Company, based in central Oregon. We have been a leader in manufacturing outdoor fabric decorative products, kinetic spinners & kites for over 30 years! We take pride in our award winning designs. Our product development team pays attention to every detail using the best fabric compositions, color trends, printing techniques, sewing & embroidery applications. In addition, we are using innovative connectors, fiberglass, string, swivels, adherents & findings. Every step of the way we are involved in the process & design of each unique item. In the Breeze stands behind every product we make. If you have any questions or concerns don’t hesitate to us. In the Breeze believes that color processing & motion stimuli are essential to both adults & children. Get outside with your family & friends & enjoy all that In the Breeze products have to offer. Color our world with color in motion! -the In the Breeze team","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l3RcU8UkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"In the Breeze","source_asin":"B07ND4J1HH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-304621","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ND4J1HH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ND4J1HH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
