window.products.push({"id":304649,"name":"SGT KNOTS International Dive Flags - Nylon Diver Down Flag - Nylon Alpha Flag - Scuba Diver Flag - Boat Flag Marker for Snorkeling, Diving, Underwater","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bKEygoUoL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"nylon About this Item INTERNATIONAL DIVE FLAGS - Internationally recognized nylon scuba diver flags to satisfy global diving safety requirements. We offer both the US and international versions. SYNTHETIC DURABILITY - Our rugged diver down flag is made with 100% top quality nylon to ensure long-lasting, everyday use. Nylon is highly resistant to degradation from UV rays, moisture, abrasions, chemicals, and oils. FLAG STIFFENER - Optional flag stiffener keeps the boat flag open and visible under all weather conditions. SIZES & COLORS - SGT KNOTS Diving Safety Flag is available in two versions: US version (Red & White) and International version (Blue and White). Dive Marker Flags come in three different sizes: 14 inches x 18 inches, 20 inches x 24 inches, and 31 inches x 36 inches, with the option of a built-in flag stiffener. VETERAN OWNED and OPERATED - Just like the Marine Corps, SGT KNOTS is committed to be the best of the best. We continue to live by the motto, Semper Fidelis—Always Faithful. Our loyalty to our customers is what makes us who we are, and the reason we continue to grow in popularity and product offerings. We promise to maintain the strength and consistency of our products. We also pass down our bulk savings to our customers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bKEygoUoL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SGT KNOTS","source_asin":"B07GSHZQJD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-304649","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GSHZQJD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GSHZQJD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":304650,"name":"Exotic Pakkawood 6-Piece Kitchen Utensil Set with 12-in Spoon, 12-in Slotted Spoon, 12-in Spatula, 12-in Corner Spoon, 13-in Large Spurtle, 9-in Small","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DjXcUie3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Crate Collective 6-Piece Utensil Set is specially crafted for your culinary needs. Each spoon and spatula is unique and serves its own purpose - the 12\" Spoon and Slotted Spoon are great for stirring and draining soups and pasta, while the 12\" Corner Spoon lets you scrape hard-to-reach corners in your pots. The 12\" Straight-Edge Spatula is perfect for sautéing, flipping meat, and serving brownies and the 13\" slotted spurtle & 9\" spurtle are great for a plethora of uses Beautify Your Kitchen with Exotic Wood - Replace your boring plain black utensils with colorful & exotic pakkawood to spice up your space and bring new life to your kitchen. Our pakkawood is made from layers of premium hardwood and infused with chemical-free 100% natural food grade dyes to create colorful patterns and shapes. Due to the handmade nature of our products, there may be slight variations in color and/or craftsmanship. Scratch-Proof & Safe on Non-Stick Cookware - Island Bamboo pakkawood wooden utensil sets are fully nonstick and highly resistant against stains and wilting. These wooden spoons will not leave scratches on your cookware, including stainless steel, ceramic, and cast iron pots and pans. Lightweight, yet durable and gentle, these beautifully designed kitchen tools get the job done. Earth-Friendly & Good for the Environment - Kick your plastic spoons & spatulas to the curb and invest in a product that's good for the earth! Unlike traditional cookware tools, pakkawood is chemical free, meaning it's good for you and the planet. No need to worry about melting or burning plastics into your food. Make Clean-Up Easy - These non-stick utensils are quick and easy to clean and take the hassle out of kitchen clean-up. For best results, hand wash with warm soapy water and towel dry. As a precaution, we do not recommend soaking for long periods of time, as this can eventually damage the wood.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DjXcUie3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crate Collective","source_asin":"B08L9NC9FH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-304650","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L9NC9FH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L9NC9FH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
