window.products.push({"id":304662,"name":"Cake Decorating Supplies Kit, 132pcs Baking Pastry Tools for Beginner, Spherical Mold, Cake Turntable Stand, 3 Russian Piping Nozzles, 48 Numbered Pip","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dRgmN0WnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COMPLETE CAKE DECORATING KIT: 1 Cake Board+1 Non-Stick Cake Turntable+48 Icing Tips+1 Small Cleaning Brush+2 Flower Nails+1 Silicone Decorating Pen+3 Russian Tips+3 Cake Scrapers+9 Fondant Cake Carved Pens+1 Cake Flower Lifter Scissor+50 Disposable Icing Bags+1 TPU Reusable Pastry Bag+2 Icing Coupler+1 Cake Leveler+1 Whisk+1 Spherical Mold+1 Straight Icing Spatula+1 Angled Icing Spatula+5 Pastry Bag Ties+1 Tri-Color Coupler. LACE NON-SLIP ROTATING TURNTABLE: This cake turntable is 11 inches with lace on the edge. It uses hidden ball bearings to rotate smoothly. It can be rotated counterclockwise or clockwise, helping you to easily decorate cakes for various activities. Both have benefits. It also comes with an 8-inch cake tray for easy placement of the cake base. You can use a straight spatula to icing the round cake from the side, and use an inclined spatula from the top as you rotate the turntable. SEMI SPHERE MOLD & WHISK:Semi spherical non-sticky and flexible mold making it easy to make chocolate bombs, cupcake decorations, chocolate snacks, and more. The whisk is great for whipping meringues, eggs, and batter. You can use the 9cs carving pen to draw the favorite pattern on the cake. When carving, you can directly use 2 couplers or 3-hole converters to replace the suction head without changing the piping bag. You can use the cleaning brush to clean the narrow top of the tip. EASY TO USE: This cake tools set having numbered tips with Patter Chart and instruction use for cake leveler. Which tips produce what kind of decoration, just have a look on Pattern Chart where we have provided. You can also get EBook by scanning QR code to find out how to use. The silicone decorative pen can help you write on the cake, and the same as using a normal pen. Use flower nails with petal tips to make roses, and decorate the petals on the cake with piping scissors. BEST GIFT FOR CAKE LOVER: Every part of a kit is well packed and good quality, suitable for any ages and levels of cake-making. You can easily purchase this as a Birthday, Wedding, Mother Day, Christmas, Easter gift to your friends or kids. Your satisfaction is what drives us to provide the highest quality products. If you receive cracked or incomplete kit, please feel free to contact our customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dRgmN0WnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iKanzi","source_asin":"B09B6X8L1L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-304662","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B6X8L1L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B6X8L1L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
