window.products.push({"id":304689,"name":"LAMEJOR Duvet Cover Set Twin Size Halloween Decor Black Skull Skeleton/Paisley Floral Pattern Luxury Soft Bedding Set Comforter Cover (1 Duvet Cover+2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1mJdDBPpCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔【WHAT YOU CAN GET】: It does NOT include the comforter. This is duvet COVER, it's a cover for comforter or duvet. You need to put your own duvet inside just like you put a pillow inside the pillowcase. 1 Twin duvet cover(85\"L x 68\"W), 2 pillowcases(30\"L x 20\"W). This Skull Skeleton Duvet Cover offers a luxuriously soft hand feel, and it also provides breathability, wrinkle-resistance, and long-lasting strength. Duvet Cover has a zipper closure and ties to secure the insert. ✔【SKULL SKELETON DECORATION DESIGN】: Cool skull design printed bedding sets. This duvet cover set highlights Halloween atmosphere, also very suitable as a gift for your family or friends. It is a perfect choice for all style room, especially psychedelic Gothic style room. Perfect gift for teens, boys, girls, men or women.Rich array of skull theme will infuse fresh and personality into your home, perfect for the Holiday New Year, and Christmas, All Season. ✔【PREMIUM FABRIC】: Our Duvet Cover Set is woven from the highest quality microfiber material, the feel of the fabric is like percale “cotton” (It is not cotton) and will continue to soften with each wash. Create a serene sleeping experience, leaving you feeling ultimate softness and comfort. Our Duvet Cover Sets are are Fade and Pilling Resistant. They will come out of the dryer looking fresh every time. And yes, they also are Wrinkle Resistant. ✔【EASY USE & CLEANING】: Each Duvet Cover complete with zipper closure, and it is easy to remove and wash. Also there are ties at each corner of the duvet cover, your comforter will stay in place nicely in the duvet cover. Machine washable in cold water and tumble dry on low. Fade, stain, shrink and wrinkle resistant. ✔【ULTIMATE GIFT IDEA】: If you are looking for something as a Christmas, New Year, Holidays, Birthday's gift to your mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, daughter and all other beloved ones, this duvet cover set is a absolutely gorgeous choise.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1mJdDBPpCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LAMEJOR","source_asin":"B0BP66DFB5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-304689","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BP66DFB5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BP66DFB5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
