window.products.push({"id":304818,"name":"Rolling Pin with Thickness Rings with Silicone Baking Mat Set, GUANCI Stainless Steel Dough Roller, Non-Stick, Heat-Resistant Pastry Baking Mat for Ba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wOyYhf9iS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ADJUSTABLE ROLLING PIN - 4 sizes of detachable rings: 1/16, 1/8, 1/4, and 3/8 inches to knead the dough to the desired thickness. If all the rings are removed, it will become the original straight rolling pin. For novices or veterans, it is easy to knead to the desired thickness. HIGH QUALITY AND NON STICKY- the rolling pin is made of food grade 304 stainless steel. High-grade brushed stainless steel finish, no rust! Non-sticky and easy to clean. Because of the smooth and seamless design, the dough will not stick together like plastic or wooden rolling pins. EASIER TO BAKE - The 17-inch adjustable rolling pin can be used to make any dough mixture you can think of, such as pizza, bread, pies, pastries, biscuits, pasta, etc. The stainless steel rolling pin is more labor-saving and more suitable for teaching children to bake. LARGE FOOD GRADE SILICONE PASTRY MAT - 25*17.5inch ultra-large silicone baking mat. It made of food-grade platinum silicone, it is non-sticky and easy to clean. The silicone baking mat has a measuring function, so you can easily roll the dough into the required size. The mat has strong adhesion to the countertop and will not slide on the countertop. And it can withstand temperatures from -40°F to 482°F. PERFECT FOR BAKERS, HOME BAKING- Whether you are baking professionally or at home, stainless steel rolling pins and silicone pastry mats are ideal baking tools. If you are not satisfied with your product, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wOyYhf9iS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GUANCI","source_asin":"B0893BRF4W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-304818","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0893BRF4W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0893BRF4W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
