window.products.push({"id":304820,"name":"Vegetable Peeler Stainless Steel Blade Potato Butternut Squash Fruit Kitchen Ergonomic Super Y Pro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Xd2Yyxm5L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"This amazing Y Peeler is a great gift, ask for it as the Super Y Pro Cut the Food, not your own hands with this Super “Y” Pro Peeler  With the Super “Y” Pro Design you will find that your hands will be out of the way of the blades and you will be always safe and will have a lot of fun peeling your favorite fruit or vegetable  Whether peeling an apple or a fruit with a tougher skin, the Super “Y” Pro is most suitable for the task.  Ideal for Potatoes, Carrots, Apples, Cucumbers, Pears and much more. Blades position is the best for effective peeling The way the Blades are positioned in the Super “Y” Pro, makes peeling a very effective job  The angle of the blades is in the perfect position to cut below the surface without wasting your food. Easily peel and remove blemishes and bruises from produce with this sturdy Fruit and Vegetable Peeler  The excellent design not only includes the best handling but also durable and resistant materials that make the Super “Y” Pro one of the best in the market.  The Super “Y” Pro can peel through veggie skins like butter and will last so long that will be one of your favorite tools in the Kitchen   It´s Ergonomic design and size will fit great in most hand sizes and you will find it handy and convenient for every member of the family. It works in right or left hand. Whether peeling an apple, potato, squash or a fruit with an even tougher skin, the Super “Y” Pro is a must tool in any kitchen   Its easy to maneuver, safe, the stainless-steel blades make peeling simple by contouring to almost any surface shape.  The pressure-absorbing rubber handle puts less tension on the hands, while providing an outstanding grip. Our peelers are great gifts for people with arthritis. We have a no hassle 100% guarantee refund policy. Consider picking up an extra one to make peeling a wonderful experience with the family or your team in the kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Xd2Yyxm5L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Super \"Y\" Pro","source_asin":"B00P556RJI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-304820","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00P556RJI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00P556RJI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
