window.products.push({"id":304869,"name":"Bisda Silverware Set, 5 Piece Premium Stainless Steel Hammered Kitchen Utensil Flatware Cutlery Sets of 1, Mirror Polish, Dishwasher Safe (5-Magic Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41GZ-p4dkFL._AC_.jpg","description":"Description： This amazing cutlery set is best described as contemporary and timeless, with a luxe look. Your set will be one-of-a-kind, customized for you and will come clean, sterilized, polished and ready to use. all with a mirror polished finish for a sophisticated appearance, which adds visual interest without taking the focus away from your plate. With this set, creating an unforgettable tabletop presentation is always effortless. No silverware set is the same, what you get is unique! If you are looking for a special way to thank your dinner guests, let them take their set home as an luxurious gift or wedding favor... Feature: STURDY - High quality 18/8 stainless steel, durable for your daily use, Last for years, Bend resistance DESIGN - Hammered, Shinny appearance with mirror polish, Which makes your table settings elegant and different. VERSATILE - Perfect for daily use, parties, gathering, casual or formal occasion. TECHNOLOGY - Smooth edge with no rough marks, Never need re-polish EASY CLEAN - Easy and convenient to clean by hand wash and also dishwasher safe, will not flade or scratch. MEET DIFFERENT DEMAND - With unique colors to meet different demand. Color: Orange Red PACKAGE CONTENTS: Dinner Knife: Length 9.25 inch Dinner Spoon: Length 7.87 inch Dinner Fork: Length 7.87 inch Salad Fork: Length 7.32 inch Teaspoon: Length 6.50 inch WHAT'S INCLUDED: -1 x Dinner Knife. -1 x Dinner Fork -1 x Salad Fork -1 x TeaSpoon -1 x Dinner Spoon. USING INSTRUCTION: 1.Please wash the butter Knife sets with warm soapy water before first using to wash off any processing residue left from manufacturing. 2.Please use a neutral detergent to wash the silverware set after using and dry it before storage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41GZ-p4dkFL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bisda","source_asin":"B08V97RH7L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-304869","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08V97RH7L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08V97RH7L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
