window.products.push({"id":304891,"name":"Kahler Omaggio Mini Ceramic Vase 3-Pack - Height 80mm (3.1 In.) Diameter 50mm (2 In.) - Handmade Faience (White / Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":51.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KJcsbxG2L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The Omaggio series is a modern design classic. The iconic hand-painted stripes are represented in countless Nordic homes and loved by design enthusiasts all over the world. In this pack of three Omaggio Mini vases, the black stripes are different on each identically sized vase. Being hand-painted, each set is unique. With a height of 3.1 inches and a diameter of 2 inches, these small vases are perfect for use as bud vases and also look beautiful as an arrangement of their own. Other products are available in the Omaggio series, including different sized vases, matching serving bowls and dishes (search for \"Kahler Omaggio\"). The modern Omaggio vase was inspired by Tulle Emborg, one of the talented women painters in Kahler's Danish workshop in the 1930s and 1940s. As in the old Kahler workshop, each and every stripe has been hand-painted by talented women painters. The vases then go through multiple hand processes in connection with glazing, quality checking and fine polishing. The design has been reinterpreted and revived by the talented designer duo Stilleben (Ditte Reckweg and Jelena Schou Nordentoft). \"We have always been totally fascinated by Kahler's epoch-making ceramics, which have played an enormous part in putting Denmark on the map when it comes to art and design. It is a great pleasure to help bring the art ceramics heritage into a new era and a new form language\", say the two designers. It is Kahler's mission to create accessible art for the people. Now a leading Scandinavian design brand, their roots go back to 1839 as a small Danish pottery producer. For more than 175 years, their tradition has been to collaborate with significant artists to provide distinctive and contemporary collections. Kahler is firmly established as part of Danish cultural heritage, and they strive to preserve history and traditions in each handmade design. Height 80mm (3.1 In.) Diameter 50mm (2 In.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KJcsbxG2L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kahler","source_asin":"B07BWKX711","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-304891","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BWKX711","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BWKX711","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":304892,"name":"Saflon Titanium Nonstick 13.75\" Roasting & Lasagna Pan 4mm Forged Aluminum with PFOA Free Coating from England","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zFIwT7c5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LATEST TECHNOLOGY: 4mm of forged aluminum provides a thicker, stronger pan that is coated with three layers of premium QuanTanium nonstick titanium coating MOST DURABLE: Titanium-coated aluminum is scratch resistant and almost three times more durable than classic Teflon, ceramic, and granite-coated roasting pans. EVEN HEATING: Cook like a pro with a thicker forged aluminum roasting & lasagna pan that heats up faster and delivers reliable, even heating every single time ECO-FRIENDLY: The Saflon QuanTanium roasting and lasagna pan is oven and dishwasher safe and nonstick in addition to being PFOA-free, lead-free, and cadmium-free BONUS GIFT: Easily store nonstick titanium roasting and lasagna pan in a bonus storage bag and enjoy a 30-day money back satisfaction guarantee. Measures 13.75\"X10.25\"X2.75\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zFIwT7c5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAFLON","source_asin":"B075BWP32V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-304892","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075BWP32V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075BWP32V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
