window.products.push({"id":304896,"name":"Sofa Buddy - Convenient Couch Cup Holder, Couch Caddy, Sofa Cup Holder. The Perfect Couch Accessory","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UZ0BPEEuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NO MORE SPILLS - You know what’s really annoying? When you're watching TV and there is no cup holder within arms length to rest your drink. SofaBuddy solves this problem by giving you access to a cup holder and accessory holder right at the comfort of your sofa. No more spills, no more searching for remotes, or gaming controllers. Indeed, the SofaBuddy is the world's greatest and most loyal sofa companion you could ask for. SOFA BUDDY WEIGHT SYSTEM - Sofa Buddy is equipped with weights hidden within the coaster holes to ensure a strong stationary hold. This significantly improves user experience as user inserts and removes their drink inside Sofa Buddy. This is one of the main differentiators between Sofa Buddy and other competitor brands SOFA BUDDY ANTI TILT SYSTEM - At the bottom of all coaster holes are hard plastic pieces that ensure your beverage can rest on a 100% horizontal flat surface; this improves user experience. This is in contrast to competitor brands that simply rely on the cushion foam to secure drinks. This can cause minor spills. This is another differentiator between Sofa Buddy and competitor brands SOFA BUDDY ANTI SLIP LINING - Sofa Buddy is equipped with anti slip lining at the bottom of the cushion to further promote a strong stationary hold. Our competitors do not include this to save costs PATENT PENDING - Sofa Buddy was developed by our in-house industrial designers and is currently patent pending. You will not find this same model anywhere and is 100% exclusive to Sofa Buddy","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UZ0BPEEuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sofa Buddy","source_asin":"B09BCHVMLN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-304896","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BCHVMLN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BCHVMLN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
