window.products.push({"id":304904,"name":"Joyloce Gifts for Husband from Wife, To My Husband Wine Tumbler 12 oz, Romantic Birthday Gifts for Him Coffee Mug Cup, Husband Gifts for Anniversary V","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RBclS8TuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💝A Perfect Tumbler For Your Love Husband💝 Insulated Wine Tumbler Features: 1. Our Insulated Wine Tumblers Have A Double-Wall Exterior With A Vacuum Seal Between The Walls Which Means Your Drink Will Stay At Its Ideal Temperature For Hours. Also The Exterior Will Never Sweat Or Get Hot Or Cold To The Touch.2. Durable And Environment Friendly. Made Of High-Quality Food-Grade 18/8 Stainless Steel, All The Wine Tumblers Are Durable And Recyclable To Cut Down On Household Waste With Every Refill.3. Great Gift For All Ages. The Insulated Wine Tumbler Is Perfect Gift Idea For Parties Of 30th, 40th 50th, 60th, 70th, 80th Birthday, Anniversary, Wedding, Engagement, Proposing, Valentines Day And So On. Insulated Wine Tumbler Design: 1. Perfect Size -- 12 Oz Capacity Can Totally Satisfy Your Daily Needs. Suitable Size Suitable For Camping, Traveling, Office, Home And Other Place.2. User Friendly -- The Tumbler With Modern Curved Design Is Easy To Hold. Removable Cup Lid Can Keep Reduce The Spill.3. Leak Proof Lid -- Removable Abs Lid Tightly Sits In Your Cup To Prevent Splash And Spills. Also, The Straw Lid Is Perfect For Cold Beverages. Warm Notice: Not Microwave Safe. Hand Wash Recommended.Keep Children Away From The Wine Tumbler When It Is Filled With Hot Liquid. Package Contended: 1 X Wine Tumbler1 X Packing Box","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RBclS8TuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joyloce","source_asin":"B0BZZ9BH7Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-304904","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZZ9BH7Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZZ9BH7Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":304905,"name":"MOSCOW MULE SET OF 4 16 OUNCE MUGS SOLID COPPER","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UdzsjLELL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What better way to serve the timeless Moscow Mule than in an Old Dutch Moscow Mule Mug. The Moscow Mule is a classic cocktail usually served in a copper mug that has been refreshing tastebuds since the 1940's. That famous blend of vodka, ginger beer, and lime juice can be enjoyed, especially so, with OUR set of 4 Moscow Mule Mugs. Featuring an attractive smooth finish to please the eye, each mug is also made of Solid Copper, which not only keeps your drink cool, but brings out the flavors of your mule recipe. Each mug is built to last with a lacquered coating to prevent tarnishing, and nickel lining for easy maintenance. Our Moscow Mules are not intended for dish washer use. Doing so will cause product discoloration. Hand wash with warm soapy water, and dry thoroughly with a dry cloth. This product is not microwave safe. Look for the ODI stamp on the bottom of your mug to guarantee you’re drinking out of an ORIGINAL Old Dutch product. For a new twist on the Moscow Mule cocktail, try a refreshing Raspberry Mule. 1 Part Vodka 1 Part Lime Juice 1 Part Raspberry Puree 1 Whole Raspberry\" Serve it on our Original Moscow Mule Mug for the perfect drink.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UdzsjLELL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Select","source_asin":"B00IYNVJQE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-304905","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IYNVJQE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IYNVJQE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
