window.products.push({"id":304989,"name":"Wine Stopper, EraVino Vacuum Pump Wine Saver with 2 bottle Stoppers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pX6YsCBNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Don't be afraid of closing the day with a glass of a great wine just because you're not going to drink the entire bottle at once. Now you'll be able to just get relaxed whenever you want with a glass as if you had just opened the bottle with your EraVino Vacuum pump and bottle stoppers. Reasons You're Going to LOVE Your New Wine Vacuum Pump: 1. Extremely easy to use (Pump a few times to remove excess air of your bottle) 2. It comes with 2 great stoppers that DO NOT LEAK (Just press the push button to release the vacuum, you can forget about those messy leaks in the fridge) 3. Peace of mind about safety standards (FDA, CE/EU, SGS Certification) 4. Used by the most experienced chefs and sommeliers The idea for the EraVino Vacuum Pump Wine Saver with 2 bottle Stoppers emanated directly from the taste of spoiled wine - something that it’s inventors wanted to prevent once a bottle had been opened. The EraVino Vacuum Pump extracts the air from an opened wine bottle and re-seals it using a rubber stopper. The airtight vacuum inhibits the oxidation process that is responsible for the deterioration of wine. The vacuum is created by placing a stopper into the neck of the opened bottle and pumping it until resistance is detectable. The pump incorporates a patented 'click' mechanism that indicates when a sufficient airtight environment has been established. The EraVino Vacuum Pump Wine Saver with 2 Bottle Stoppers is suitable for all but sparkling wines. It is highly durable and easy to clean via wiping with warm water and conventional detergents (if necessary). The Vacuum Stoppers are dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pX6YsCBNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ERAVINO","source_asin":"B010BXVSQ0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-304989","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B010BXVSQ0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B010BXVSQ0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":304990,"name":"GFCC 90x90 inch White Polyester Tablecloth Square Table Cloth Seamless for Wedding Party Birtday Decoration Event Supplies","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51z9qFVIdmL._AC_SL1002_.jpg","description":"GFCC polyester tablecloth features a seamless design making it ideal for use at any wedding venue. This rectangular tablecloth is made with corners to avoid puddling on the floor. Round tablecloths are available in a wide array of colors designed to complement nearly any color scheme. Our tablecloths are made of woven polyester and are designed to be durable, wrinkle and stain resistant, and can be laundered countless times. These tablecloths are not only affordable but uniquely designed. Machine washable for many cycles and stain resistant, they are perfect for every celebration imaginable ranging from weddings, children and birthday parties, to graduation and especially banquets, even corporate and entertainment events. For proper care: Our polyester material needs to be washed in cold water with normal detergent. Stain remover is OK if necessary, bleach is OK for whites. Bespoke: GFCC main products are polyester tablecloths, stretch tablecloths, spandex chair covers ,spandex chair sashes,sequin tablecloths,sequin tablerunners,sequin backdrops,burlap lace table runners. We also offer a bespoke service, so if you cannot find the size or colour you need then please contact us with your requirements. Decorate your reception tables with brand new 90\"x90'' polyester tablecloths! Information: * Size:90x90 inch square * Size:90x90 inch square * Color:White * Color:White * Material: 100% Polyester with stain and wrinkle resistant. * Material: 100% Polyester with stain and wrinkle resistant. * Package included: 1 x tablecloth with seamless design. * Package included: 1 x tablecloth with seamless design. * Edges are folded and then hemmed. * Edges are folded and then hemmed. Please note: This tablecloth is 90'' size,it can't drop if cover 90''x90'' table!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51z9qFVIdmL._AC_SL1002_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GFCC","source_asin":"B081L46L7L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-304990","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081L46L7L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081L46L7L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
